# Public keys of MonitorFlow's plugin catalogue (ADR-0103): Ed25519, in
# PEM (SubjectPublicKeyInfo), as `monitorflow-plugin keygen` prints them.
# The server and the agent are built with every key here, and a plugin
# signed by one of them is shown as official.
#
# None yet: the owner makes the key offline with `monitorflow-plugin
# keygen`, keeps the private half off every server and out of this
# repository, and adds the public half here. Until then plugins install
# only with a publisher key an administrator trusts.
#
# This is not the release key (deploy/release-keys.pem), which signs code
# that runs as root and signs nothing else.
